### ==========================================
### 认证模块 — Authentication
### 路径前缀：/auth
###
### 首次使用：
###   1. 先执行 ### Login 获取 accessToken
###   2. 手动将 accessToken 值粘贴到 00-global-variables.http 的 @authToken 中
###   3. 或直接拷贝 token 到请求头 Authorization: Bearer <token>
###
### 备用 curl 命令（无需变量）：
###   curl -X POST http://localhost:9000/auth/login \
###     -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
###     -d '{"username":"vben","password":"123456"}'
### ==========================================

### @baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 登录（获取 Token）-------------------
### @name Login
# 无需认证。返回 accessToken + currentTenantId + tenants + subTenants
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vben",
  "password": "123456",
  "captchaKey": "",
  "captcha": "",
  "roleId": null
}

### ------------------- 注册 -------------------
### @name Register
# 无需认证。注册成功自动返回登录凭证
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "pass123",
  "email": "newuser@example.com"
}

### ------------------- 验证码登录 -------------------
### @name Code Login
# 无需认证。手机号+验证码登录，用户不存在则自动创建
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/code-login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "code": "123456"
}

### ------------------- 忘记密码 -------------------
### @name Forget Password
# 无需认证。通过邮箱验证码重置密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forget-password HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "newPassword": "newPass123",
  "code": "verifyCode"
}

### ------------------- 退出登录 -------------------
### @name Logout
# 需要认证（Authorization 头）。使当前 token 失效
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 刷新 Token -------------------
### @name Refresh Token
# 无需认证（使用旧 token 换取新 token）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "{{authToken}}"
}

### ------------------- 获取权限码列表 -------------------
### @name Get Auth Codes
# 需要认证。返回当前用户在当前租户下的权限码
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/codes HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 切换角色 -------------------
### @name Switch Current Role
# 需要认证。切换后在响应中返回完整上下文（userInfo + tenants）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/current-role HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": 2
}

### ------------------- 切换租户 -------------------
### @name Switch Tenant
# 需要认证。切换后自动进入该租户下的第一个工作空间
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/switch-tenant HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": 1
}

### ------------------- 获取用户工作空间列表 -------------------
### @name Get User Workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/sub-tenants HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取用户租户列表 -------------------
### @name Get User Tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/tenants HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
